+/// Follows a wake's job from hjv-api's answer to the request (design v3 §8-5): every
+/// kHjvWakePoll `poll` asks for the job, unless the dot of the PC's card (`online`) says by then
+/// that the PC is up, and kHjvWakeFor after the request (`began`) the wait is over, whatever
+/// hjv-api says. `show` gets every state on the way, the last one is the result. Once `current`
